## User

Merge two sorted lists into one sorted list.

## Type

type
```haskell
merge :: Ord a => [a] -> [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
merge [] ys = ys
merge xs [] = xs
merge (x:xs) (y:ys)
  | x <= y = x : merge xs (y:ys)
  | otherwise = y : merge (x:xs) ys
```

